  <h2>Trusted Legal Representation in Garrett County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Garrett County, Maryland's westernmost and most mountainous county, is known for Deep Creek 
    Lake, Wisp Resort, and stunning natural beauty. While it's a popular destination for outdoor 
    recreation, residents and visitors alike can face serious legal challenges. Attorney Alex 
    Poberesky provides experienced legal representation to Garrett County clients.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Garrett County</h3>
  
  <p>
    The mountainous terrain, winter weather conditions, and recreational activities in Garrett 
    County create unique risks for accidents and injuries. Whether you've been hurt in a car 
    accident on a mountain road, injured while skiing at Wisp Resort, or suffered harm in a 
    boating accident on Deep Creek Lake, you deserve compensation for your losses.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle personal injury cases throughout Garrett County, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on mountain roads and I-68</li>
    <li>Skiing and snowboarding accidents</li>
    <li>Boating accidents on Deep Creek Lake</li>
    <li>ATV and off-road vehicle accidents</li>
    <li>Hiking and outdoor recreation injuries</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents at resorts and businesses</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at Garrett Regional Medical Center</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Garrett County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Criminal charges in Garrett County require experienced legal defense. Whether you're a 
    resident or a visitor who was arrested, we can help. We defend clients against DUI charges, 
    drug offenses, assault, and other criminal matters.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Committed to Garrett County Clients</h3>
  
  <p>
    Although our office is in Pikesville, we travel to Garrett County to serve our clients. 
    We understand that residents of Maryland's mountain region need access to experienced 
    legal representation, and we're committed to providing that service. Distance is not a 
    barrier to quality legal help.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Garrett County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Garrett County, including Oakland, Deep Creek Lake, 
